        "label": "Process",
        "description": "Which boomtime process to read logs from: the always-on server, the always-on AMQP image worker, or the KEDA ScaledJob drain pods that run the heavy DB job kinds. Default All covers every one of them and excludes the co-located postgres/rabbit/dragonfly pods.",
